            "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:04:20.093867+00:00",
            "notes": "For this round there a few things you can do depending on the money you have.\n\n14K+ CASH: Buy [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) to increase your damage and lethality.\n\n13K+ CASH: Buy [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) and [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) to improve your cleave damage against armor. **Can also buy this over [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) if you notice they have a lot of armor and it's hard to kind of get through the armor.\n\n10K+ CASH: Get [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) to get an increased 20% damage and maybe [Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) if you can afford it.",
