            "created_at": "2025-09-21T17:04:20.093867+00:00",
            "notes": "This round is crucial to this build and where this build differs from other similar builds for winston. By getting [Tesla Field](item_68f73d99-6d07-40f5-ad28-0c69f45487c7) as the power and [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505). You now have a bubble that not only isolates enemies, but applies increased electric damage and reduced healing, which makes you even more lethal on your dives. \n\n[Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) is the only true must buy this round and you can keep whatever combo of stuff you bought last round if you find that it's working. But also if you're too poor to buy [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505), I recommend selling whatever you  bought last round, buying [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505), and then going back to last rounds notes to buy what it recommends based on how much money you have left.",
